WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:11.170
33. The Nazca Lines of Peru. Flying over southern Peru, you may look down to see a

2
00:00:11.170 --> 00:00:19.730
flat red land covered in white sketches of hummingbirds, fish, monkeys, dogs, and plants.

3
00:00:19.730 --> 00:00:27.490
They're simple line drawings, but they're huge. Some of the biggest are nearly 270 meters.

4
00:00:27.490 --> 00:00:34.930
Who made them? Why? Experts believe the huge pictures called Nazca Lines were built by the

5
00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:40.270
Nazca people of ancient Peru. They aren't certain when the lines were made, but they

6
00:00:40.270 --> 00:00:48.570
estimate between 200 B.C. and 8600. The drawings are so huge and beautiful that some people

7
00:00:48.570 --> 00:00:54.690
believe that the ancient Nazca people couldn't have made them. They believe the Nazca lines

8
00:00:54.730 --> 00:01:00.690
are clear signs that aliens or people from more advanced civilizations visited the Nazca

9
00:01:00.690 --> 00:01:08.490
people and helped them. There is no other evidence for this theory. Many other experts and scientists

10
00:01:08.490 --> 00:01:14.330
have experimented using the tools of the Nazca people, and they've shown that the Nazca really

11
00:01:14.330 --> 00:01:19.570
could have made the lines themselves. The lines and drawings must have been hard to organize,

12
00:01:19.570 --> 00:01:26.530
but relatively easy to make. The basic process was to clear away the red stones that covered

13
00:01:26.530 --> 00:01:33.410
the desert to show the white earth below. That's why, from far away, the lines look lighter than

14
00:01:33.410 --> 00:01:40.770
the land. This brings us to another question. Why would the Nazca people build huge figures

15
00:01:40.770 --> 00:01:47.690
that could only be seen from the sky? Perhaps the drawings were for their gods looking down

16
00:01:47.810 --> 00:01:55.010
from the sky. Other theories say that the lines pointed to stars and planets or to sources of

17
00:01:55.010 --> 00:02:02.490
water. However, there is no complete agreement on the purpose of the lines. As with many ancient

18
00:02:02.490 --> 00:02:09.970
monuments, we may never be able to say how or why, but we can still appreciate their beauty and

19
00:02:09.970 --> 00:02:13.690
marvel at the accomplishments of our ancestors.
